  "rationale": "D4, data-informed. The numbers of the third-generation candidate D2 (flex_heptane.wsp2), unchanged, plus the broad component for a prefix that shows an unstable tracker, with the thresholds and weights typed for the first fourth-generation candidate from the train cases. Written after that candidate, which bundled the component with sharper laws and narrower bands, scored worse than the third generation on validation; the rule for this one was stated before its validation score existed: it replaces the carried candidate only if its validation CRPS is not higher than the carry's. Every number typed by the author; no fit, no search.",
